<title>SOUTH KOREA: Kia says it will take action against Samsung.</title>
<headline>Kia says it will take action against Samsung.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Kia Motors said on Thursday it planned to take legal action against Samsung Motors Inc for disseminating false information about Kia.</p>
<p>&quot;We will seek legal compensation for expected huge losses and the damage to our reputation that the false information could cause, and we plan to file a complaint with the prosecution office,&quot; Kia said in a statement.</p>
<p>Kia said Samsung argued in an internal report that confidence in Kia's top manager had been lost and that Kia faced &quot;internal managerial conflicts&quot; and that Kia had reached its maximum growth potential.</p>
</text>
